      "status": "published",
      "summary": "When an attacker that you can see hits you with an attack roll, you can take a Reaction to halve the attack’s damage against you (round down).\n\nTomeStack: the halving is offered in the damage panel for a hit from an attack; that you can see the attacker is by hand.",
      "effects": [
