      "status": "published",
      "summary": "Whenever you make an ability check that uses one of your skill or tool proficiencies, you can treat a d20 roll of 9 or lower as a 10.\n\nTomeStack: the floor applies to every check that adds your proficiency bonus; whether a tool you are proficient with is in use is by hand.",
