      "status": "published",
      "summary": "You’ve trained to get into especially hard-to-reach places, granting you these benefits.\n\nClimber. You gain a Climb Speed equal to your Speed.\n\nJumper. You can determine your jump distance using your Dexterity rather than your Strength.\n\nTomeStack: the Climber line is automatic (a Climb Speed equal to your Speed); the Jumper line is by hand.",
